{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"paul-wu","name":"Paul Wu","birthDate":"","birthPlace":"","bio":"Paul Wu is a DGA/DGC director based out of Vancouver, Canada.\n\nHis career in film spanning almost 3 decades started in front of the camera as an actor and stunt performer before moving behind the camera as a fight choreographer, stunt coordinator and now Director.\n\nHe has directed 2 episodes of Quest out West: Wild Food for APTN, Charmed for CBS/CW and the \"Wild Things\" promo video for the BC Lions.\n\nHis ability to choreograph and shoot stylized action while emphasizing character and story garnered him a chance to direct for CBS/CW on \"Charmed\". His many years as Head of the Stunt Department fostered a collaborative approach with both cast and crew as well as instilling a deep appreciation for strong preparation (PREP).\n\nPaul is looking to direct more episodic TV especially in the genres of Action, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:43:00+00:00","tmdbId":1224673,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1224673","credits":[{"id":"deadpool-2","title":"Deadpool 2","character":"Hong Kong Boss"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/paul-wu.webp","filmography":[{"name":"The Smashing Machine","year":2025,"character":"Pride Referee (2000)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cwwvrdYeIrARXdiv09GIO6XWK5l.jpg"},{"name":"The Smashing Machine","year":2025,"character":"Pride 2000 Referee","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cwwvrdYeIrARXdiv09GIO6XWK5l.jpg"},{"name":"Alaska Daily","year":2022,"character":"Bucket Truck Op","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/acHxZIwGmCmPd2FPqykdFfu1IyF.jpg"},{"name":"Upload","year":2020,"character":"Stunt Coordinator","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6TPGDrU9MyWbn2TpggJphVAVXiq.jpg"},{"name":"Once Upon a Deadpool","year":2018,"character":"Hong Kong Boss","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/